    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"page\" id=\"page-seed-crawler\">\n  <div class=\"page-header\">\n    <div class=\"page-eyebrow\">Plant / Undead · Hazard · CR 1/2 · XP 100</div>\n    <div class=\"page-title\">Seed Crawler</div>\n    <div class=\"page-subtitle\">An orthogenic organism — not quite a creature, not quite a plant — that seeks flesh to germinate in</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"lore-box\"><p>\"The alien seed is not a metaphor. I made it literal. You're welcome.\" — D.C., letter to an unnamed colleague, unsent</p></div>\n  <div class=\"stat-block\">\n    <div class=\"sb-head\">\n      <div class=\"sb-name\">Seed Crawler</div>\n      <div class=\"sb-type\">Tiny plant (undead), unaligned</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">CR 1/2</span><span class=\"tag\">100 XP</span><span class=\"tag tag-green\">Hazard / Swarm</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sb-body\">\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Armor Class</div><div class=\"attr-val\">12</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Hit Points</div><div class=\"attr-val\">13 (3d4 + 6)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Speed</div><div class=\"attr-val\">20 ft, burrow 10 ft</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"core-stats\">\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">STR</div><div class=\"cs-val\">4</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–3)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">DEX</div><div class=\"cs-val\">14</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+2)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CON</div><div class=\"cs-val\">14</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+2)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">INT</div><div class=\"cs-val\">1</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–5)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">WIS</div><div class=\"cs-val\">6</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–2)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CHA</div><div class=\"cs-val\">1</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–5)</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Skills</div><div class=\"attr-val\">Stealth +6</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Resistances</div><div class=\"attr-val\">necrotic</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Condition Immunities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">blinded, charmed, deafened, exhaustion, frightened, poisoned</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Senses</div><div class=\"attr-val\">blindsight 30 ft, passive Perception 8</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Special Traits</div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Living Seed</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">The seed crawler exists to implant itself. It has no other drive. It does not eat, sleep, or die naturally — but will not survive more than 30 days without implanting in flesh.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Spider Climb</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">The seed crawler can climb difficult surfaces, including upside-down on ceilings, without an ability check.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Actions</div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Implant</div><p class=\"action-desc\"><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +4 to hit, reach 5 ft, one creature. <em>Hit:</em> 2 (1d4) piercing damage and the seed crawler implants itself beneath the target's skin and dies. The implanted creature must succeed on a DC 13 Constitution save at the end of each long rest or suffer one level of exhaustion as the seed germinates. After 3 failed saves (cumulative), a Tiny orthogenic plant emerges from the target's skin (painlessly, per Diane's design), and the exhaustion ends. The plant is harmless and can be removed with a DC 12 Medicine check or any healing magic of 2nd level or higher. Diane can see through the plant if she is within 1 mile.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Evasion (Reaction)</div><p class=\"action-desc\">When the seed crawler is targeted by an attack, it may use its reaction to move up to 10 ft without provoking opportunity attacks.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "public": ""
      },
